      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_df9b4a4e5718c814feea1142bf51172ec5730f33f9062ef6a905e8cffeb34cfd"
      ],
      "text": "The package layout includes agent.py (main loop, 213 lines), llm.py (streaming client, retry, cost, 267 lines), context.py (three-tier compaction), session.py, permissions.py, hooks.py, mcp.py, cli.py, config.py, and a tools/ directory with bash, edit, grep, glob, read, write, todo, and sub-agent tools."
    },
