      ],
      "text": "The product ships a CLI with an interactive REPL and a one-shot mode ('corecoder -p \"...\"' that exits when done), plus REPL slash commands such as /model, /compact, /tokens, /diff, /undo, /plan, /save, and /sessions."
    },
