        "slc_cab028894b431b14bb1753d48bf7f5af1dee9dd9b6053d9a27babe92c4c448ad"
      ],
      "text": "The package can be imported as a library: the top level exports Agent, LLM, and Config, and an example constructs an LLM with model, api_key, and base_url and calls Agent(llm=llm).chat(...)."
    },
