        "slc_2853ebd8a9710800372c8f105fd7fa40449919fd5a1f3c39871ea32d2e7931f3",
        "slc_4b86c6689fce72ab1dc96f7d7c4380492dcec75377e3d8569a84644539a30a36",
        "slc_4bc7fa148d5826819fabfaa103358f9ceb1c6e988e2fead4192ff40a8c483345"
      ],
      "text": "The agent speaks the OpenAI-compatible API by default; providers are configured via environment variables (OPENAI_API_KEY, OPENAI_BASE_URL, CORECODER_MODEL), with an optional LiteLLM extra routing to a hundred-plus providers and .env loading at startup."
    },
    {
