        "slc_c82474a21d987d8835e1ca3ea977ff1aa31de5826486f01d8de740fb693eebeb"
      ],
      "text": "Sessions can be saved and listed under ~/.corecoder/sessions; session IDs are sanitized to safe filename characters so a malicious session name cannot traverse out of the directory."
    },
