        "slc_c188f7cb66dd8f4df0f487f7cd87d3af6ed74d325f4309f1fd2a1ac1ca2361e0"
      ],
      "text": "edit_file uses unique-match search-and-replace rather than line numbers: no match returns the file start for re-anchoring, multiple matches require more context, and success returns a diff."
    },
