      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_14adac8dd0227a44d599e454085fc205c4e4fe5ecf962081cf78fdfba7ac5ddd",
        "slc_2122ec6e560b444ff2b61c4adf407de07599e35988b24c84e513d45efcb5621d"
      ],
      "text": "If ~/.corecoder/mcp.json exists, MCP servers start as stdio subprocesses and their tools register as mcp__<server>__<tool>, treated like built-ins by hook matchers and the consent gate; the client implements only initialize, tools/list, and tools/call, with 15s handshake and 60s call timeouts."
    },
