        "slc_d3cfbe5011fa4d4b1f75df40a46d52cbf6d8cd344977388f89f0893c05734f9f"
      ],
      "text": "Hooks configured in ~/.corecoder/hooks.json run user shell commands around tool calls: pre hooks receive tool_name/tool_input on stdin and can veto with exit code 2 (stderr returned to the model), post hooks only observe, and hooks that error or exceed ten seconds are skipped with a warning."
    },
