      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_d939dba8bd45ac9e349524038d1bc35492bc6c7ff12aa285207784d0fe7f3905"
      ],
      "text": "Plan mode, toggled via /plan, refuses all mutating calls (writes, edits, bash, MCP tools, sub-agents) and returns refusals to the model as ordinary tool results until the user approves the presented plan; it is a single Agent flag plus a refusal branch ahead of the consent gate, with no plan file persisted."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_02bf3680c86e6f29590633c15bd7cf3e2ab09589845a3b75f9599ca5c2312ae4",
