        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_621ae31c1d41fc920fa3371d1bba8321fd5b90a1e0b6daeaf2d9c7c5eef53e13"
      ],
      "text": "By design, the product omits several capabilities: bash dangerous-command blocking is only a regex blacklist (not a sandbox), retry is exponential backoff only (no fallback model or dollar budget), sub-agents are synchronous only, there is no RAG, and the MCP client implements no resources or prompts."
    }
